---
// /en/credentials/ (Ф2): те же сканы, EN-подписи. Данные: src/data/credentials.ts.
import Page from '../../../layouts/Page.astro';
import { psyCerts } from '../../../data/credentials';

const psy = psyCerts.map((c) => ({
  href: `/certificates/${c.slug}.jpg`,
  img: `/certificates/preview/${c.slug}.jpg`,
  title: c.en,
  org: c.orgEn,
  year: c.year,
}));
---

<Page
  title="Credentials · Valeriy Karasaev"
  description="MSc in Psychology (HSE University), Gestalt therapist (Moscow Gestalt Institute, 733 hours), Erickson International (ICF), group analysis. 2,500+ hours of training. Diploma and certificate scans."
  lang="en"
  wide={true}
  translation="/credentials/"
>
  <div class="page-head">
    <div class="kicker">Education and Qualifications</div>
    <h1 class="page-title">What my work stands on</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      My path combines two worlds - psychology and business. That is a deliberate choice:
      deep work with people requires understanding the reality they live in.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      Altogether: 2,500+ hours of professional training, personal therapy and supervision.
      Below is not a trophy list, but what my practice actually stands on. Every scan opens full size.
      Certificates are in Russian and English; the documents speak for themselves.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="meta-line"><span class="meta-num">01</span><span class="meta-label">Psychology and coaching</span></div>
  <div class="grid-3">
    {psy.map((c) => (
      <a class="cert-card" href={c.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        <img src={c.img} alt={c.title + ' - ' + c.org} loading="lazy" />
        <div class="cert-meta">
          <div class="cert-title">{c.title}</div>
          <div class="cert-org">{c.org}{c.year && ' · ' + c.year}</div>
        </div>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="meta-line"><span class="meta-num">02</span><span class="meta-label">Personal therapy and supervision</span></div>
  <div class="spec">
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Own therapy</span><span class="spec-val">12 years · 1,000+ hours</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Group therapy</span><span class="spec-val">400 hours over 5 years</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Supervision</span><span class="spec-val">450+ hours · group and individual</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Ongoing specialization at MGI</span><span class="spec-val">in progress</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I believe a therapist must go through their own therapy - otherwise they solve their own
      problems at the client's expense. These hours are not a resume line. They are where I work from.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="meta-line"><span class="meta-num">03</span><span class="meta-label">Management qualifications</span></div>
  <div class="spec">
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Project Management Professional (PMP)</span><span class="spec-val">Project Management Institute</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Lean Six Sigma Black Belt · 200+ hours</span><span class="spec-val">Pyzdek Institute</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Professional Scrum Master</span><span class="spec-val">Scrum.org</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">PMO and Portfolio Management · 260 hours</span><span class="spec-val">Bauman University</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">BSc in Economics</span><span class="spec-val">Plekhanov University</span></div>
    <div class="spec-row"><span class="spec-key">Engineering degree</span><span class="spec-val">MADI</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      17 years in international business - Abbott, BMW, Bosch, teams of up to 300 people across
      30 countries - shape how I work with leaders and professionals. More on the
      <a href="/en/">main page</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

</Page>
